3. LOCAL EMPIRICAL POWER
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

For adjacent intervals:

    p_eff(T) = -log_2(D(2T)/D(T)).

If D(T) ~ C T^(-p), then p_eff(T) -> p.

This is an OBSERVATION of the computed data, not an
assumption built into the integration.

